{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Look to the covenant</b> — with a pataḥ under the lamed, and it is known, and the word הבט takes a bet of exchange [i.e., as a prefix meaning 'to'], and הבט is plene [with vav]." "And the sense of <b>dark places of the earth</b> — corresponding to 'look to': the hidden places there." "<b>Pastures</b> — like 'pastures of shepherds' [נאות רועים, Jeremiah 25:36]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 74, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:32.375028688Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}